---
const genes = [
  {id:'A', x:150, y:90, values:[1,2,3,4,5]},
  {id:'B', x:400, y:90, values:[1,3,2,5,4]},
  {id:'C', x:150, y:245, values:[5,4,2,2,1]},
  {id:'D', x:400, y:245, values:[2,5,1,4,3]},
];
function pearson(a:number[],b:number[]){
  const ma=a.reduce((s,x)=>s+x,0)/a.length, mb=b.reduce((s,x)=>s+x,0)/b.length;
  const da=a.map(x=>x-ma),db=b.map(x=>x-mb);
  return da.reduce((s,x,i)=>s+x*db[i],0)/Math.sqrt(da.reduce((s,x)=>s+x*x,0)*db.reduce((s,x)=>s+x*x,0));
}
const edges=genes.flatMap((g,i)=>genes.slice(i+1).map(h=>({a:g,b:h,r:pearson(g.values,h.values)})));
---
<section class="coexpression-demo" data-coexpression aria-labelledby="coexpression-title">
  <h2 id="coexpression-title">共表达网络教学演示</h2>
  <p>原理示意：四个虚构基因在五个虚构样本中的表达量计算 Pearson 相关。调整阈值可观察保留的无向相关边。</p>
  <div class="control"><label for="correlation-threshold">相关系数绝对值阈值</label> <input id="correlation-threshold" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.7" data-threshold /><output data-output for="correlation-threshold">0.70</output><button type="button" data-reset>重置</button></div>
  <div class="coexpression-scroll"><svg viewBox="0 0 550 325" role="img" aria-labelledby="coexpression-svg-title coexpression-svg-desc">
    <title id="coexpression-svg-title">四基因无向共表达网络</title><desc id="coexpression-svg-desc">节点代表基因，青绿色实线为正相关，橙色虚线为负相关；只显示绝对相关系数达到当前阈值的边。</desc>
    {edges.map(e=><line x1={e.a.x} y1={e.a.y} x2={e.b.x} y2={e.b.y} stroke={e.r>=0?'#197b73':'#a45c29'} stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray={e.r<0?'8 6':undefined} data-edge data-abs={Math.abs(e.r)} style={Math.abs(e.r)<0.7 ? 'display:none' : ''}/>)}
    {genes.map(g=><g><circle cx={g.x} cy={g.y} r="29" fill="#fff" stroke="#17324d" stroke-width="2"/><text x={g.x} y={g.y+6} text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#17324d">{g.id}</text></g>)}
  </svg></div>
  <p>青色实线表示正相关，橙色虚线表示负相关；共表达关系不代表直接调控。示例仅为说明计算过程，五个样本不足以支持实际网络推断。</p>
  <details><summary>查看示例表达值和计算结果</summary><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption>模拟表达值，按样本 1 至 5 排列</caption><thead><tr><th>基因</th><th>表达值</th></tr></thead><tbody>{genes.map(g=><tr><th>{g.id}</th><td>{g.values.join('，')}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table><table><caption>Pearson 相关系数（四舍五入至两位小数）</caption><thead><tr><th>基因对</th><th>相关系数</th></tr></thead><tbody>{edges.map(e=><tr><th>{e.a.id}—{e.b.id}</th><td>{e.r.toFixed(2)}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></details>
</section>
<script>
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-coexpression]')){
 const input=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-threshold]')!, output=root.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>('[data-output]')!;
 function update(){const threshold=Number(input.value);output.value=threshold.toFixed(2);for(const e of root.querySelectorAll<SVGElement>('[data-edge]')) e.style.display=Number(e.dataset.abs)<threshold?'none':'';}
 input.addEventListener('input',update);root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{input.value='0.7';update()});update();
}
</script>
<style>
.coexpression-demo{padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;background:#f8fbfa;margin:2rem 0}.coexpression-demo h2{margin-top:0}.control{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem}.control input{accent-color:#197b73}.control output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.control button{border:1px solid #9aadb5;border-radius:6px;background:white;padding:.45rem .8rem;cursor:pointer}.coexpression-scroll{overflow-x:auto}.coexpression-scroll svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:550px;min-width:320px;margin:auto}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}.table-wrap table{margin:1rem 0;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.table-wrap th,.table-wrap td{padding:.4rem;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #d7e3e7}.table-wrap caption{text-align:left;font-weight:600}
</style>

